port/539404/73736539404_20_10_22.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539404/69020539404.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539404/5394040320.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539404/5394040319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539404/5394040318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539404/5394040317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539404/5394040316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2015/SATIN_CREDITCARE_NETWORK_LTD-539404-MARCH-2015.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2014/SATIN_CREDITCARE_NETWORK_LTD-539404-MARCH-2014.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2013/SATIN_CREDITCARE_NETWORK_LTD-539404-MARCH-2013.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2012/SATIN_CREDITCARE_NETWORK_LTD-539404-MARCH-2012.PDF","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Satin Creditcare Network Limited reported its H1 FY27 results, highlighting a standalone PAT of INR292 crores and consolidated AUM of INR16,589 crores. Management noted strong portfolio asset quality with a standalone GNPA of 1.9% and increased the management overlay buffer to INR50 crores. The company reiterated its long-term guidance and targets, including a consolidated AUM target of INR32,000 crores by 2030 with 30% from non-microfinance businesses. Satin Creditcare Network Limited released its investor presentation for the quarter and half year ended September 30, 2026, reporting strong financial and operational results across its standalone and consolidated entities. Consolidated AUM reached ₹16,589 Crores, representing a 31% year-on-year growth, while consolidated profit after tax for H1FY27 stood at ₹299 Crores.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company expects to land within the guided range of 20% to 25% consolidated AUM growth for the full year.","quote":"On consolidated AUM growth, we guided 20% to 25% for the full year. We have grown 9% in the first half, which annualizes to roughly 19%. We are approaching the range rather than inside it and we want to be straightforward about that. The second half is seasonally a stronger period for disbursement, and on the basis of our current pipeline, we expect to land within the guided range for the full year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management guided a standalone credit cost range of 3% to 3.5% for FY27.","quote":"On standalone credit cost, we guided 3% to 3.5%. We are at 2.8% for the half year, and that is after adding to our overlay rather than releasing it. We are ahead.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management guided a standalone return on asset range of 3.5% to 4% for FY27.","quote":"On standalone return on asset, we guided 3.5% to 4%. We are at 4.3% for the half year on a reported basis, which is above the top of the range even after absorbing the INR50 crores buffer, we are ahead.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"The company has set a consolidated AUM growth guidance of 20-25% for FY27.","quote":"Consolidated AUM Growth 20–25%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3fef86b5-a74d-460a-bd69-5cfa8c2684c7.pdf"},{"claim":"Standalone credit cost guidance for FY27 is maintained at 3.0-3.5%.","quote":"Standalone Credit Cost 3.0–3.5%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3fef86b5-a74d-460a-bd69-5cfa8c2684c7.pdf"},{"claim":"Standalone return on assets (ROA) guidance for FY27 is targeted between 3.5% and 4.0%.","quote":"Standalone ROA 3.5–4.0%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3fef86b5-a74d-460a-bd69-5cfa8c2684c7.pdf"},{"claim":"The consolidated AUM is targeted to reach ₹32,000 Crores by FY2030.","quote":"Consolidated AUM targeted to reach ₹32,000 Crores by FY-2030 : 52% of the Target Achieved","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3fef86b5-a74d-460a-bd69-5cfa8c2684c7.pdf"},{"claim":"The management guided for a consolidated AUM growth of 20% to 25% for FY27, implying INR18,200 crores to INR18,900 crores by March '27.","quote":"Guidance for FY27. Our guidance for FY27 is consolidated AUM growth of 20% to 25%, implying INR18,200 crores to INR18,900 crores by March '27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"},{"claim":"Management guided for stand-alone credit cost of 3% to 3.5% on a reported basis for FY27.","quote":"Stand-alone credit cost of 3% to 3.5% on a reported basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management noted that rural cash flow recovery following the monsoon has been very encouraging.","quote":"We had earlier indicated that the revised outlook warranted caution on rural cash flows over the subsequent two to three months. That period has now passed and the recovery has now been very encouraging.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Karnataka and Maharashtra each account for 1% of the on-book portfolio.","quote":"Our exposure is negligible. Karnataka and Maharashtra account for 1% each of our on-book portfolio.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated they have not witnessed any stress in repayment in Karnataka and Maharashtra.","quote":"Also, as of now, we have not witnessed any stress in repayment in these states.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the non-MFI portfolio stands at 20% of consolidated AUM.","quote":"Non-MFI portfolio now stands at 20% of consolidated AUM against 15% a year ago, and we are on track to achieve the target of 30% by 2030.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that H2 seasonally experiences higher growth.","quote":"*H2 has seasonally higher growth","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3fef86b5-a74d-460a-bd69-5cfa8c2684c7.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that the industry has successfully transitioned from repair to expansion.","quote":"As for the sector, we can say with confidence that the industry has moved from repair to expansion.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"},{"claim":"Specialist lenders are carrying more of the microfinance market than at any point in recent memory.","quote":"Specialist lenders are carrying more of this market than at any point in recent memory.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Management expects to open about 50 branches in the second half of the year.","quote":"So I think the second half we will open close to about 50-odd branches, which will be there.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Branch openings for next year are expected to be in the range of 100 to 150.","quote":"Next year looking at how we are able to plan out this year, it could probably be in the range of about 100 to 150.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"The operating expense ratio was 6.6% compared to 7.2% a year ago.","quote":"Our operating expense ratio was 6.6% against 7.2% a year ago.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Cost-to-income improved to 41.6% from 49.8%.","quote":"Cost-to-income improved to 41.6% from 49.8%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Marginal cost of borrowing reduced by 65 basis points year-on-year to 10.28%.","quote":"Our marginal cost of borrowing reduced by 65 basis points year-on-year to 10.28%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Marginal borrowing cost reduced by 65bps YoY to 10.28% in Q2FY27.","quote":"Marginal borrowing cost reduced by 65bps YoY to 10.28% in Q2FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3fef86b5-a74d-460a-bd69-5cfa8c2684c7.pdf"},{"claim":"Stand-alone NIM improved to 14.36% from 13.16% on a gross yield of 22.44% against a cost of funds of 8.08%.","quote":"On margins and efficiency, stand-alone NIM improved to 14.36% from 13.16% on gross yield of 22.44% against a cost of funds of 8.08%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"},{"claim":"The operating expense ratio improved to 6.33% from 6.98% in Q4.","quote":"Our operating expense ratio improved to 6.33% from 6.98% in Q4 as the 392 branches added last year begin to season.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"},{"claim":"Cost to income improved to 44.49% from 48.91% year-on-year.","quote":"Cost to income improved to 44.49% from 48.91% year-on-year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"},{"claim":"Reported credit cost for the quarter was 3.06%, within the guided range of 3% to 3.5%.","quote":"Our reported credit cost for the quarter was 3.06%, an improvement of over 175 basis points year-on-year and within our guided range of 3% to 3.5%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Standalone AUM stood at INR13,608 crores, up 23% year-on-year.","quote":"Standalone AUM stood at INR13,608 crores, up 23% year- on- year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Consolidated disbursements for the quarter stood at INR3,697 crores, up 41% year-on-year.","quote":"Consolidated disbursement for the quarter stood at INR3,697 crores, up 41% year- on- year, taking first half disbursements to INR7,192 crores, up 48% year- on- year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Consolidated AUM reached INR15,935 crores, growing 27% year-on-year and 5% sequentially.","quote":"Consolidated AUM reached INR15,935 crores, growing 27% year-on-year and 5% sequentially.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"},{"claim":"X-bucket collection efficiency was 99.9% and every top state was at 99.6% or better.","quote":"X-bucket collection efficiency was 99.9% and every one of our top states is at 99.6% or better.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The management overlay was increased from INR36 crores to INR50 crores during the quarter.","quote":"We have taken the management overlay from INR36 crores to INR50 crores this quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Capital adequacy strengthened to 27.89% from 26.74% in June.","quote":"Capital adequacy strengthened to 27.89% from 26.74% in June and 26.5% a year ago.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Net worth stands at INR3,437 crores, up from INR3,243 crores in June.","quote":"Net worth stands at INR3,437 crores, up from INR3,243 crores in June.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Promoters have committed INR100 crores through warrants, and the first tranche of INR25 crores has been received.","quote":"The promoters have committed INR100 crores through warrants, and the first tranche of INR25 crores has already been received by the company.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"Promoters committed ₹100 Crores by warrants, with the first tranche of ₹25 Crores already received by the company.","quote":"Promoters committed ₹100 Crores by warrants, first tranche of ₹25 Crores already received by the company.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3fef86b5-a74d-460a-bd69-5cfa8c2684c7.pdf"},{"claim":"The company raised ~₹5,630 Crores in H1FY27 via diversified debt instruments on a standalone basis.","quote":"Standalone: - Raised ~₹5,630 Crores in H1FY27 via diversified debt instruments.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3fef86b5-a74d-460a-bd69-5cfa8c2684c7.pdf"},{"claim":"Standalone liquidity as on 30th September stood at ₹2,235 Crores with ~₹4,600 Crores of undrawn sanctions in hand.","quote":"- ~₹4,600 Crores of undrawn sanctions in hand; Liquidity as on 30th September stood at ₹2,235 Crores.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3fef86b5-a74d-460a-bd69-5cfa8c2684c7.pdf"},{"claim":"The company raised approximately INR3,000 crores during the quarter through diversified instruments.","quote":"We raised approximately INR3,000 crores during the quarter through diversified instruments, including INR285 crores of subordinated debt, which took our subordinated liabilities to INR497 crores and supported a capital adequacy ratio of 26.74%, up from 25.39% in March.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"},{"claim":"Shareholders approved the promoter infusion of INR100 crores at approximately a 17% premium to the minimum issue price under SEBI regulation.","quote":"Shareholders have approved the promoter infusion of INR100 crores at approximately a 17% premium to the minimum issue price under SEBI regulation.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=90c3b889-651a-41e1-9e47-a07047397bb2.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Assam had four districts severely impacted by floods.","quote":"Assam, where four districts were severely impacted by floods, has almost fully recovered with no discernible impact on our credit cost.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be7c3201-4574-4679-ada9-0b7bc508b60a.pdf"},{"claim":"The revised monsoon outlook warrants caution on rural cash flows over the next 2 to 3 months.","quote":"The 